<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fruit Battlegrounds</Major>
    <Description>This is a macro for a Roblox game Fruit battleground
it is a AFK fruit level farm for Mythical fruit Leopard
This macro will press all the skills for you, as well as when you achieve the transformation of the leopard.
I hope this macro will be useful and you won't have to spend a lot of time online anymore.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы</Comment>
